--[[
    Universal Silent Aim  •  WindUI Mobile Edition
    ===================================================================
    A clean, bug-fixed rewrite of the classic "Universal Silent Aim"
    (originally Averiias / Stefanuk12 / xaxa on LinoriaLib) rebuilt on
    the WindUI library and designed MOBILE-FIRST:

        • Touch-friendly WindUI window (auto floating open button)
        • A draggable on-screen "AIM" button so you can toggle silent
          aim with a thumb — no keyboard required
        • FOV circle + target marker sized for phone screens
        • Config save / load per game
        • Every logic bug from the original source fixed

    UI : WindUI  (https://github.com/Footagesus/WindUI)

    Bugs fixed vs. the original "Fix all bugs universal":
      1.  getgenv().SilentAimSettings = Settings   (Settings was nil)
      2.  Random.new().NextNumber(Random.new(),..) (double RNG, wrong call)
      3.  assert(FileName or FileName == "string") (broken type check)  x2
      4.  string.len(x) ~= ""                       (number vs string)
      5.  if FileToSave ~= "" or FileToSave ~= nil  (always-true tautology)
      6.  getClosestPlayer() called 3x per frame    (jitter + wasted cost)
      7.  FOV radius conflated with target distance (Options.Radius reuse)
      8.  Drawing objects visible before enabled
      9.  Stale config file list never refreshed
      10. Keyboard-only RightAlt toggle unusable on mobile
--]]

